    <name>Linear Programming</name>
    <description>
        A open-source utility library for linear programming in Java with the simplex algorithm.
        Problems are of the type: min/max c*x st. Ax &#10094;= b x >= 0 The primal problem is solved using Gauss-Jordan elimination and the lexicographic rule for pivoting is used.

        Handles:
        — maximization and minimization problems
        – equality and inequality constraints
        — negative and positive constraint values.
    </description>
